[{"text":"FCLoopAddAuxiliaryMass[expr, {k1, k2, ...},-m^2,n] adds auxiliary mass term \\(m^2\\) to the propagators in the list that depend on loop momenta k1, k2, .... For \\(n=0\\) the mass is added directly.","anchor":"fcloopaddauxiliarymass"},{"text":"For \\(n>0\\) the function applies the exact identity from arXiv:hep-ph/9711266, known as infrared rearrangement, \\(n\\) times. The option Last allows to add a flag to the last term in the expression as a check that it does not contribute to the physical results.","anchor":"fcloopaddauxiliarymass"},{"text":"Overview, FeynAmpDenominatorCombine.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"FCLoopAddAuxiliaryMass[{FAD[k + p]}, {k}, -M^2, 2]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(k+p)^2}\\to -\\frac{M^2}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}+\\frac{1}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )}+\\frac{M^4}{((k+p)^2+i \\eta ).((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopAddAuxiliaryMass[{denHead[FAD[k + p]]}, {k}, -M^2, 2, Head -> denHead]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(k+p)^2}\\right)\\to -\\frac{M^2}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}+\\frac{1}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )}+\\frac{M^4}{((k+p)^2+i \\eta ).((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopAddAuxiliaryMass[{denHead[FAD[k + p]]}, {k}, -M^2, 2, Head -> denHead, \"MassHead\" -> auxM]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(k+p)^2}\\right)\\to \\frac{\\text{auxM}\\left(-M^2\\right)^2}{((k+p)^2+i \\eta ).((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}+\\frac{\\text{auxM}\\left(-M^2\\right)}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}+\\frac{1}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopAddAuxiliaryMass[{denHead[FAD[k + p]]}, {k}, -M^2, 3, Head -> denHead, \"MassHead\" -> auxM, Last -> flag]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(k+p)^2}\\right)\\to \\frac{\\text{flag} \\;\\text{auxM}\\left(-M^2\\right)^3}{((k+p)^2+i \\eta ).((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^3}+\\frac{\\text{auxM}\\left(-M^2\\right)^2}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^3}+\\frac{\\text{auxM}\\left(-M^2\\right)}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )^2}+\\frac{1}{((k+p)^2-M^2+i \\eta )}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopAddAuxiliaryMass[{denHead[FAD[{k + p, M}]]}, {k}, -M^2, 0, Head -> denHead]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{denHead}\\left(\\frac{1}{(k+p)^2-M^2}\\right)\\to \\frac{1}{(k+p)^2-M^2}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"}]